<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise, Suez to requote on Monday.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise, Suez to requote on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The shares of Lyonnaise des Eaux and Cie de Suez, suspended on Friday pending their merger announcement, will requote on Monday April 14, Suez chairman Gerard Mestrallet said.</p>
</text>
